gfork-47p.2: new daemon heartbeat step (checkContextPressure) that snapshots each persistent agent's (witness/refinery/deacon) current context from its Claude Code JSONL and, at a YELLOW threshold, nudges 'gt handoff --cycle'; at RED (idle + crash-loop/backoff/usage-limit guards clear) force-cycles via executeLifecycleAction. Token accounting is a SNAPSHOT of the newest main-chain non-sidechain assistant usage event (input+output+cache_read+cache_creation), never a sum (cache_read grows monotonically). New internal/agentlog/context.go (ProjectDirFor + CurrentContextTokens) resolves each role's own CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR; DaemonThresholds config + operational.go accessors clamp red>yellow and floor yellow. F2: handoff --cycle fresh-starts patrol roles (ContinueSession = !isPatrolRole), bridged through ExtractSimpleRole for the compound GT_ROLE.

Validated this session: gofumpt/vet/build green; agentlog/config/daemon/cmd test-race green (forced, no cache). Hermetic golden-number fixtures prove snapshot-not-sum. E2E/hammer soak pending (lead gate).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
